  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Pasture Management and Adaptation with Resilient Technologies for Herders in Mongolia (SMART-Herders)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the new CP now in advanced stages of formulation, the Office of the President requested UNIDO#s technical support for the preparation and subsequent implementation of a project for herders in Mongolia. Based on discussions with the potential donor and government counterparts, the project will seek to identify climate smart options for livestock management and livelihoods. It will be funded through IFAD adaptation fund resources channeled through the Office of the President in Mongolia. UNIDO AGR/FSS will provide the requisite technical backstopping. PA of EUR 25,000 is therefore requested to meet the cost of UNIDO#s technical support to the Government of Mongolia in the preparation of the SMART-Herders project</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
